  "review": {
    "imagery": "Root reviewed both original brochure indexes and all 20 scoped website resources. Fifteen selected original renders comprise 14 website images and one native bedroom resource from current brochure physical page 44. Red-overprint duplicate views and the website banner were excluded. Architecture and amenity concepts remain scoped to the Olfah community. No delivery status inferred from render artwork.",
    "floorPlans": "Root visually reviewed all 73 delivered complete sheets and all 90 visible residence-area headers. Building 4/5 paired PDF text order is reversed in several places, so manual visible left/right figures control every label. Building 1 printed total and later net/gross definitions remain distinct. Repeated B.5 sheets, B.1 area differences, Building 2 bedroom-header error and Building 3 disputed floorplate heading remain explicit. Original five drawing PDFs and current brochure retain byte/hash and physical-page links.",
    "location": "Root reviewed the complete current web map and original brochure physical page 7, including all printed estimates and the additional 7-minute road entry. Both sources remain regionally scoped. Current brochure community overview and all five marked building spreads are delivered intact. No surveyed coordinates or kilometre journey inferred.",
    "provenance": "Normal-GET dated URL/byte/SHA256 receipts cover all eight research documents, official HTML and 20 website resources. Source masters remain unchanged. Existing commercial research, owner and protected identity preserved."
  },
