    "Surveyed visitor entrance, live routes, kilometre journeys, contracted unit revision and final finishes remain unverified. Building 3 pack floorplate ownership is disputed by its Olfah 2 heading. Building 1 repeated/type-area inconsistencies and Building 2 bedroom-header error remain explicit. Detailed Building 6–12 layouts were not located in the reviewed official packs."
